WEBVTT

00:18.880 --> 00:23.580
The future has given the light
of glory to the men of the present!

00:24.050 --> 00:28.960
Yes, the time has finally come
when we will conquer all our fears!

00:29.660 --> 00:32.960
Ancient man rubbed together
pieces of wood to create fire!

00:33.230 --> 00:39.000
For oil, men once fought and killed the whale,
and later they fought and killed each other!

00:39.200 --> 00:41.100
Then came nuclear power!

00:41.240 --> 00:44.230
In every age, we lived with
such dangers all around us!

00:44.770 --> 00:47.110
But now it will be different!

00:47.370 --> 00:51.370
We no longer need to fear!
The night is finally ours!

00:51.480 --> 00:54.040
This time for certain, we
will have our beautiful night!

00:54.520 --> 00:57.080
This is not an illusion!

01:19.910 --> 01:21.570
In a future to come...

01:21.710 --> 01:27.980
mankind has developed an epoch-making
energy system, the Shizuma Drive.

01:28.250 --> 01:32.280
This absolutely safe,
non-polluting system...

01:32.450 --> 01:36.720
replaced every
conceivable energy source...

01:37.260 --> 01:40.720
putting an end to the
depletion of oil resources.

01:41.830 --> 01:45.730
Even the nuclear reactors were dismantled.

01:46.530 --> 01:50.370
But within the shadows
of this bright peace...

01:50.570 --> 01:53.410
two powers clash against each other.

01:55.140 --> 01:59.200
A secret organization bent on
world domination, the BF Group!

02:01.620 --> 02:03.550
Everything for Big Fire!

02:23.840 --> 02:27.270
And to oppose this threat,
the Experts of Justice...

02:27.370 --> 02:30.140
is formed from members
gathered all across the globe!

02:30.580 --> 02:33.550
With them is the most
powerful robot on the planet...

02:33.680 --> 02:37.810
Giant Robo, and the
young man who commands it.

02:38.290 --> 02:40.120
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

02:43.690 --> 02:45.720
Crush them! Giant Robo!

02:51.970 --> 02:59.970
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

03:06.880 --> 03:12.340
<i>THE DAY THE EARTH STOOD STILL</i>

03:25.330 --> 03:27.670
Damn it! I'm too late!

03:29.870 --> 03:31.600
Your efforts were in vain...

03:31.710 --> 03:35.870
Kenji Murasame of the International
Police Organization, Paris Branch...

03:36.040 --> 03:38.340
You did this? How could
you do this heinous act?

03:41.750 --> 03:43.150
I-It can't be...

03:43.380 --> 03:44.380
You're...

03:44.790 --> 03:47.150
Professor Franken Von Vogler!

03:48.220 --> 03:49.220
It's revenge...

04:15.380 --> 04:19.840
No one could have predicted the
anomaly caused by the Shizuma Drives.

04:20.290 --> 04:27.160
The effect of a nearly perfect energy
system suddenly ceasing to function...

04:28.160 --> 04:31.190
was a reminder of the
"Tragedy of Bashtarle"...

04:31.670 --> 04:35.690
an incident that many wanted
to wipe from their memories.

04:45.150 --> 04:49.080
And it wasn't just an ominous
premonition of dark times to come...

04:49.750 --> 04:55.310
but a physical manifestation
before our very eyes.

04:57.090 --> 05:00.690
Yes, after a decade of silence...

05:00.790 --> 05:02.820
it came back to us
inside a black attache case.

05:03.730 --> 05:09.070
He did give me this to
give to you, Professor Go.

05:15.280 --> 05:19.340
But what could Professor
Shizuma have been trying to get to us?

05:22.820 --> 05:23.820
This is...

05:25.220 --> 05:26.220
But it...

05:30.160 --> 05:33.960
So Daisaku, the Professor
hasn't said anything?

05:34.090 --> 05:35.090
No...

05:35.500 --> 05:37.020
except that once...

05:39.200 --> 05:40.260
Daisaku...

05:40.500 --> 05:45.200
I no longer have the courage... like
you have when you control Giant Robo...

05:45.310 --> 05:48.300
but I can't let something like
Bashtarle ever happen again...

05:52.680 --> 05:55.510
I didn't understand what
he was trying to say to me...

06:04.660 --> 06:08.390
So this is the legacy of what
happened ten years ago...

06:08.800 --> 06:10.130
No doubt about it.

06:10.800 --> 06:14.670
No one besides him could make this.

06:14.940 --> 06:20.400
Then, are you saying that Professor
Franken Von Vogler survived the tragedy?

06:21.440 --> 06:24.380
I'm sure that Professor Vogler is...

06:24.780 --> 06:28.480
Then who... and for what reason?

06:29.480 --> 06:30.480
I don't know...

06:31.020 --> 06:33.820
But if all three were to
be brought together...

06:34.350 --> 06:36.410
then the Tragedy of
Bashtarle would be repeated.

06:37.620 --> 06:42.190
Because of that, I need that sample.

06:48.640 --> 06:49.640
Over here!

06:50.470 --> 06:51.770
What's going on?

06:57.710 --> 06:59.150
Alberto the Impact...

06:59.250 --> 07:01.770
Then the Magnificent Ten is on the move?

07:02.920 --> 07:06.320
Commander, their goal is obvious.

07:06.420 --> 07:09.050
Then it can't be helped,
I'm counting on you!

07:10.720 --> 07:11.720
Ginrei.

07:11.760 --> 07:12.760
Yes, sir!

07:15.630 --> 07:16.630
Go!

07:25.540 --> 07:26.540
You'll not get away!

07:30.780 --> 07:32.540
Old Man Impact!

07:33.180 --> 07:34.810
That's enough of that!

07:45.790 --> 07:48.630
Professor Go, where are we going now?

07:49.560 --> 07:51.876
We're heading to the main
headquarters of the Experts of Justice.

07:51.900 --> 07:53.390
To Ryozanpaku in the south!

07:54.200 --> 07:57.540
There, I'll determine the true
nature of the contents of this case!

07:58.340 --> 08:00.310
Is that all right with you, Professor?

08:02.840 --> 08:04.870
The true nature?

08:05.380 --> 08:07.870
Isn't that just a normal Shizuma cylinder?

08:07.980 --> 08:09.540
No, it's not!

08:09.720 --> 08:11.150
Little punk...

08:14.660 --> 08:15.950
Take a good look.

08:16.020 --> 08:17.620
This isn't an ordinary Shizuma cylinder!

08:19.030 --> 08:22.430
This is source of everything
that's happening now...

08:22.600 --> 08:28.400
Yes, it's just like the Tragedy
of Bashtarle ten years ago!

08:28.600 --> 08:29.600
What?

08:30.470 --> 08:31.560
It can't be...

08:32.070 --> 08:35.070
So that the same
mistakes aren't repeated...

08:35.240 --> 08:37.800
please tell us the truth
behind this Shizuma cylinder!

08:39.550 --> 08:40.210
Professor!

08:40.310 --> 08:44.550
Are you willing to let the Tragedy of
Bashtarle to happen all over again?

08:45.320 --> 08:46.320
Professor!

08:46.350 --> 08:47.350
Professor!

08:49.960 --> 08:50.960
I'm sorry!

08:51.960 --> 08:52.960
I'm sorry!

08:53.860 --> 08:55.330
I'm sorry!

08:55.600 --> 08:58.260
Go, I'll talk!

08:58.630 --> 09:01.120
So, please save me!

09:01.440 --> 09:03.340
I've had enough!

09:03.870 --> 09:06.530
I should never have
created the Shizuma Drive!

09:07.170 --> 09:08.770
How could you say that, Professor?

09:09.480 --> 09:11.310
The Shizuma Drive is a fabulous invention!

09:13.210 --> 09:16.210
Please, protect me from Vogler!

09:17.050 --> 09:20.040
That's enough of that talk, I think!

09:21.360 --> 09:22.360
It's...

09:22.660 --> 09:23.820
A BF Group robot!

09:24.190 --> 09:27.860
Now, hand over that case!
Along with the Professor, if you will!

09:39.610 --> 09:42.386
Evacuation is in effect! Quickly
dispose of sensitive materials and...

09:42.410 --> 09:45.870
What's the matter? Hurry up and move
Robo to the surface and evacuate!

09:46.010 --> 09:47.010
But...

09:52.850 --> 09:54.080
Robo is trying to launch?

09:54.190 --> 09:57.390
But Daisaku hasn't sent a call sign!

10:08.640 --> 10:11.300
Amazing! The power output is
fifty times greater than normal!

10:12.140 --> 10:14.540
Could it be that Robo
has an Auto Guard Circuit...

10:14.640 --> 10:16.880
that can detect a threat
to the life of the operator?

10:30.620 --> 10:31.620
Robo?

10:32.590 --> 10:33.590
Can it be that...

10:37.300 --> 10:40.790
Taiso, you should pay more attention!

10:42.000 --> 10:43.030
Now die!

10:47.410 --> 10:49.570
<i>Did something happen to Daisaku?</i>

10:55.320 --> 11:01.280
<i>EPISODE TWO, TRAGEDY OF BASHTARLE</i>

11:08.760 --> 11:09.760
Take that!

11:09.860 --> 11:12.700
I shall avenge my comrade,
Cervantes the Phantasm!

11:13.030 --> 11:16.970
And you will feel the pain I
endured when you took my right eye!

11:21.640 --> 11:23.056
Use the manipulators
that are still working!

11:23.080 --> 11:24.256
We have to clear away the rubble.

11:24.280 --> 11:25.110
Medical teams, hurry!

11:25.210 --> 11:25.650
Over here!

11:25.750 --> 11:26.770
Get a status report!

11:28.280 --> 11:31.380
Can't you get in contact with Daisaku yet?

11:31.490 --> 11:33.950
No sir, we haven't received
any signal from him yet.

11:34.550 --> 11:37.080
Is there any way to send
reinforcements to aid Taiso?

11:37.360 --> 11:40.890
No sir, the lines of communication
have been disrupted!

11:43.060 --> 11:44.500
Then there's no other option...

11:45.370 --> 11:46.560
All personnel evacuate!

11:46.670 --> 11:48.110
I'm going to self-destruct the base.

11:48.170 --> 11:49.430
Commander, where are you going?

11:50.440 --> 11:51.700
I'm going into battle!

11:52.010 --> 11:52.730
Are you sure, sir?

11:52.840 --> 11:53.840
Commander?

11:54.370 --> 11:56.970
You two need to get as far
away from me as you can.

11:57.580 --> 11:59.740
Please wait, Commander Chujo!

12:00.750 --> 12:04.680
I see no reason for Chujo the
Silent to go into battle because of this.

12:04.820 --> 12:06.680
Let us handle it!

12:07.050 --> 12:08.150
You're here!

12:10.490 --> 12:11.580
Issei and Youshi!

12:12.590 --> 12:14.960
We're headed for your location!

12:15.060 --> 12:16.590
Please hold out a little longer!

12:16.860 --> 12:18.350
All right, I'm counting on you!

12:21.700 --> 12:22.500
Let us hurry, Issei!

12:22.600 --> 12:23.600
Right!

12:27.470 --> 12:29.216
Our enemy is the
formidable Magnificent Ten!

12:29.240 --> 12:32.456
But if we work together, we'll get through
any situation, no matter how desperate!

12:32.480 --> 12:33.240
That we will!

12:33.350 --> 12:35.470
We shall show those
evildoers a thing or two!

12:37.550 --> 12:38.550
We shall, indeed!

12:46.560 --> 12:49.260
Our justice shall prevail!

12:49.800 --> 12:52.320
Sixteen in the Heavens! Eight on Earth!

12:52.830 --> 12:54.430
Woo! Fo! Tsu! Bei!

12:58.100 --> 13:03.270
<i>VILLAINS DESERVE NO MERCY.</i>

13:25.500 --> 13:27.930
How dare you!

13:34.870 --> 13:36.900
Youshi the Blue Beast is here!

13:37.440 --> 13:38.470
Die, bothersome fly!

13:44.580 --> 13:45.580
What?

13:52.690 --> 13:53.690
Curses!

14:03.070 --> 14:04.300
The impudence...

14:07.670 --> 14:11.580
Do you not realize that you've
succumbed to my Taoist Sorcery?

14:11.680 --> 14:16.710
Even a member of the Magnificent
Ten will have difficulty escaping!

14:18.950 --> 14:22.390
It doesn't matter, my attack
was merely a diversion.

14:26.160 --> 14:28.420
Ivan, Robo is headed your way!

14:28.560 --> 14:30.890
We've done our part here,
I leave the rest to you!

14:31.000 --> 14:32.860
Sir, I understand!

14:34.730 --> 14:37.570
Farewell Taiso, we'll meet again!

14:53.250 --> 14:55.620
The Magnificent Ten is quite good.

14:55.890 --> 14:58.520
They knew my exact position...

15:01.960 --> 15:04.690
D-Daisaku, is he safe?

15:20.180 --> 15:21.710
G-Ginrei...

15:24.550 --> 15:25.710
Professor...

15:28.460 --> 15:29.650
And...

15:31.420 --> 15:33.020
Where's the case?

15:39.400 --> 15:41.030
Are you awake now?

15:41.430 --> 15:43.800
Oh, how perfect, your friend has arrived.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.240
Robo!

16:04.620 --> 16:06.120
Robo's attack was stopped?

16:10.930 --> 16:11.930
A barrier!

16:19.770 --> 16:23.180
This special barrier
can't be broken so easily.

16:23.410 --> 16:25.070
But do your best...

16:32.520 --> 16:33.520
Robo...

16:34.550 --> 16:35.580
Now then...

16:36.260 --> 16:39.750
To persist on resisting is your
choice, but I too have a duty.

16:39.860 --> 16:43.520
Now, return that attache case to me...

16:43.630 --> 16:45.030
No, I won't!

17:00.980 --> 17:02.470
W-What's the matter, Robo?

17:03.180 --> 17:04.180
Robo!

17:08.990 --> 17:11.480
I understand now, Giant Robo!

17:12.230 --> 17:14.990
You can't control your
power output, can you?

17:15.260 --> 17:16.260
What?

17:16.560 --> 17:19.900
However, it would seem that the
young master you're trying to rescue...

17:20.000 --> 17:22.870
is more concerned about the
attache case than your well being!

17:29.110 --> 17:30.370
R-Robo...

17:31.810 --> 17:32.840
It's all right...

17:33.750 --> 17:35.240
You can stop, Robo...

17:46.890 --> 17:48.380
Good, now then...

17:53.430 --> 17:54.430
Where did they...

17:56.700 --> 17:57.700
Fans?

18:03.810 --> 18:04.810
Did we get him?

18:08.920 --> 18:09.970
How dare you?

18:10.180 --> 18:11.480
But it's all over!

18:12.050 --> 18:13.050
Daisaku!

18:13.220 --> 18:14.310
We missed him...

18:18.090 --> 18:19.680
Now, you too...

18:20.190 --> 18:21.220
Damned brat!

18:23.060 --> 18:25.090
This is why you're so useless!

18:25.430 --> 18:27.200
T-Tetsugyu...

18:27.470 --> 18:28.470
Excellent.

18:33.740 --> 18:34.800
No doubt about it.

18:34.910 --> 18:37.540
Now we can recreate the
Tragedy of Bashtarle!

18:38.440 --> 18:39.240
What?

18:39.380 --> 18:40.440
Are you serious?

18:40.710 --> 18:41.710
Serious?

18:43.220 --> 18:44.220
Of course!

18:44.480 --> 18:47.780
The goal of the BF Group
is world domination, after all!

18:49.390 --> 18:51.320
Tragedy of Bashtarle?

18:51.690 --> 18:53.460
Professor Go mentioned that earlier...

18:53.560 --> 18:55.500
Oh, you don't know?

18:55.600 --> 19:00.760
Then you must think the Shizuma
Drive is a fabulous invention of peace!

19:01.100 --> 19:02.730
Don't listen, Daisaku!

19:02.900 --> 19:05.170
That's right, it's better
if you didn't know!

19:05.510 --> 19:06.510
But...

19:06.840 --> 19:08.140
Oh, come on...

19:08.410 --> 19:11.000
Even if it's been wiped
out of the history books...

19:11.110 --> 19:14.840
it can't be removed
from our memories, can it?

19:18.380 --> 19:20.980
Yes, this sample was created...

19:21.090 --> 19:24.820
a short time before the
Shizuma Drive was completed.

19:25.220 --> 19:29.390
Five scientists came together to
research this "miraculous" creation.

19:30.100 --> 19:31.620
Doctor Duncan...

19:31.860 --> 19:33.130
Professor Simule...

19:33.400 --> 19:34.630
Doctor Trumble...

19:35.130 --> 19:37.540
Professor Shizuma, and...

19:38.170 --> 19:41.440
the destroyer of the world,
Professor Franken Von Vogler!

19:44.440 --> 19:48.610
When they received the honored Nobel Peace
Prize for their Energy Theory, it brought...

19:49.220 --> 19:52.910
a glimmer of hope to the depressed
and environmentally damaged Earth.

19:53.020 --> 19:55.320
The hope of a clean energy source!

19:56.120 --> 19:57.120
However...

20:01.290 --> 20:03.350
Failure after failure!

20:03.760 --> 20:04.760
And more failure!

20:06.430 --> 20:10.060
Even with a solid theory,
implementation proved difficult.

20:10.240 --> 20:13.470
As great as the world's
hopes were for this project...

20:13.670 --> 20:16.670
the voices of doubt and condemnation
from the public were even greater!

20:17.110 --> 20:20.050
Do we have any choice but to give up?

20:20.310 --> 20:25.620
Maybe a perfect energy source
was just a mere pipe dream...

20:25.950 --> 20:28.850
The scientists were on
the brink of giving up...

20:29.090 --> 20:32.680
when one of the scientists was
driven into a rash course of action!

20:38.060 --> 20:39.690
Are you out of your mind?

20:39.800 --> 20:40.890
Don't do it!

20:41.000 --> 20:41.660
Stop it!

20:41.830 --> 20:44.930
It doesn't matter, what
other choice do we have now?

20:45.100 --> 20:45.730
Stop him!

20:45.840 --> 20:47.000
Stop Vogler!

20:47.210 --> 20:48.770
He's out of control!

20:48.880 --> 20:49.880
Pull him away!

20:49.910 --> 20:51.880
Don't let him get near them!

20:52.050 --> 20:55.210
The danger those samples
pose is greater than expected!

20:55.350 --> 20:56.780
Was this all for nothing?

20:56.880 --> 20:58.080
That's right!

20:58.550 --> 21:00.380
The experiment isn't ready!

21:00.490 --> 21:01.580
It's too dangerous!

21:03.590 --> 21:04.590
It's too late!

21:06.290 --> 21:09.960
The world is waiting for
the fruits of our research!

21:10.860 --> 21:14.730
We must create this new energy
source as quickly as possible!

21:16.070 --> 21:18.060
In order to do that, we
mustn't have any fear!

21:18.710 --> 21:22.840
I have lived by this,
and I will die by it as well!

21:23.080 --> 21:25.440
What reason is there to hesitate?

21:29.080 --> 21:29.780
That's right...

21:30.050 --> 21:34.950
The Professor activated an
incomplete and untested sample!

21:35.220 --> 21:38.060
He was hoping to rush the
completion of the drive system!

21:41.260 --> 21:47.760
And so, the uncontrolled energy spread
out and vaporized an entire country!

21:50.500 --> 21:51.770
H-How could...

21:52.070 --> 21:54.270
That country's name was Bashtarle.

21:54.970 --> 21:58.000
And now, no country by that name exists...

21:58.780 --> 22:01.110
Gone, along with the place of my birth...

22:05.550 --> 22:07.110
Isn't it a masterpiece?

22:07.590 --> 22:09.990
This is what people call
the perfect energy source!

22:10.090 --> 22:11.390
Don't make me laugh!

22:11.520 --> 22:13.990
Even the BF Group wouldn't go this far!

22:14.890 --> 22:17.390
I had no idea...

22:17.530 --> 22:18.530
I didn't...

22:18.900 --> 22:21.600
But things didn't end there...

22:21.800 --> 22:22.800
What?

22:24.240 --> 22:27.260
What happened afterwards
was the true tragedy!

22:27.370 --> 22:28.370
Shut up!

22:29.210 --> 22:30.210
Shut up!

22:30.310 --> 22:31.330
Shut up! Shut up!

22:35.580 --> 22:38.920
I put my life on the
line for this atonement!

22:39.020 --> 22:39.540
Professor!

22:39.850 --> 22:40.850
What are you...

23:21.960 --> 23:24.490
T-This is just like ten years ago!

23:24.700 --> 23:25.700
N-No...

23:53.660 --> 23:54.660
Commander!

23:54.760 --> 23:57.960
I'm getting a massive energy reading
from nearby the base as well as from Paris!

23:58.160 --> 23:59.790
All right, bring up the image!

24:10.540 --> 24:11.910
What happened to the power?

24:12.280 --> 24:13.286
All Shizuma Drives are stopping!

24:13.310 --> 24:14.656
"G" storage facility unable to function!

24:14.680 --> 24:15.696
What about the reserve power?

24:15.720 --> 24:19.450
I don't know, the Shizuma Drives
suddenly stopped functioning!

24:19.790 --> 24:22.950
Are the emergency drives just as
useless as the other Shizuma Drives?

24:26.130 --> 24:27.690
Everything runs on the Shizuma Drive...

24:28.260 --> 24:30.920
including the smallest
items like a lighter.

24:32.100 --> 24:34.800
Then the entire area around Peking is...

24:52.990 --> 24:54.040
It can't be...

24:55.120 --> 24:57.590
Did Professor Go activate it?

24:57.720 --> 24:58.720
I can't say, sir!

24:59.060 --> 25:03.190
With all the Shizuma drives
non-functional, we're blind and deaf!

25:05.500 --> 25:06.500
Commander...

25:08.200 --> 25:11.600
So, as long as it's not a
Shizuma drive, it'll work, right?

25:16.240 --> 25:17.240
Taiso!

25:25.580 --> 25:27.490
Stop it! You're in no condition to...

25:28.020 --> 25:29.020
Don't worry...

25:29.190 --> 25:32.750
The generator in my
body is still working fine!

25:38.970 --> 25:39.970
Taiso!

25:44.970 --> 25:45.970
That's...

26:02.890 --> 26:03.890
Fools!

26:04.020 --> 26:05.920
How could they allow
the enemy to activate it?

26:06.860 --> 26:08.520
Can't you suppress the output?

26:08.630 --> 26:09.420
I don't know!

26:09.600 --> 26:11.640
The system itself seems
to be functioning properly!

26:14.570 --> 26:16.230
It's reacting to the third sample!

26:16.540 --> 26:18.660
Then the reading we're
getting from Peking is...

26:20.610 --> 26:21.700
We don't have a choice.

26:22.070 --> 26:25.140
We have to stop its interference
with the two samples we have here.

26:25.240 --> 26:26.240
Yes sir!

26:26.880 --> 26:29.610
So then, how long will it
take to re-establish the field?

26:30.980 --> 26:31.980
Hold it!

26:34.750 --> 26:35.550
You there!

26:35.650 --> 26:37.090
I don't think I've seen you before!

26:37.190 --> 26:38.350
Turn around and face me!

26:41.630 --> 26:42.960
You're definitely suspicious!

26:44.000 --> 26:45.000
Who are you?

26:49.700 --> 26:51.030
Are you from Interpol?

26:51.470 --> 26:53.910
They call me Murasame the Immortal!

26:54.840 --> 26:58.070
Genya! I know what you're
up to and who you really are!

27:01.580 --> 27:02.600
Leave him be!

27:04.420 --> 27:06.150
We have a change of plans.

27:07.290 --> 27:09.050
Prepare to go into Condition V!

27:09.690 --> 27:10.690
Yes, sir!

27:11.020 --> 27:14.690
Everything for Big Fire!

27:31.780 --> 27:34.300
Farewell, hypocritical
creators of the Shizuma Drive!

27:35.080 --> 27:37.980
The time for Vogler's revenge has come!

28:06.050 --> 28:09.710
It's exactly as it was with
the Tragedy of Bashtarle...

28:11.120 --> 28:12.120
You!

28:14.990 --> 28:18.220
You shall all see the
true night, right now!

28:18.690 --> 28:21.460
This is the monstrous Vogler Sphere!

28:41.380 --> 28:42.380
Something is coming out!

28:59.130 --> 29:01.100
C-Can this be...

29:01.630 --> 29:04.260
No, there's no doubt about it, it's him!

29:09.210 --> 29:11.440
I speak to the entire world!

29:12.010 --> 29:14.540
I speak to the entire world!

29:15.010 --> 29:19.380
I speak to all those who rely on
the Shizuma Drive for survival!

29:19.790 --> 29:24.950
The time has come for you to
atone for the events of ten years ago!

29:25.190 --> 29:29.750
This revenge will be carried out
under the banner of the BF Group!

29:29.960 --> 29:32.560
This is revenge against the Shizuma Drive!

29:32.800 --> 29:38.430
And this giant black sphere
will deliver the crushing blow!

29:39.170 --> 29:44.170
And its name is Franken Von Vogler!

29:46.680 --> 29:47.980
It can't be...

29:48.150 --> 29:50.050
Professor Vogler is alive?

29:50.450 --> 29:52.610
How could he have survived?

29:52.920 --> 29:55.250
He was at the center of
the tragedy when it occurred!

29:56.290 --> 29:58.950
But that's definitely the
experimental Shizuma reactor core...

29:59.060 --> 30:01.790
that caused the events in Bashtarle.

30:01.930 --> 30:07.260
Besides, who else could have recreated
the sample but <i>the</i> Professor Vogler?

30:07.430 --> 30:08.430
Who else?

30:19.310 --> 30:20.310
That's right...

30:25.620 --> 30:29.080
I survived ten years ago for this very day!

31:26.950 --> 31:28.380
The Shizuma Drives...

31:28.780 --> 31:30.550
Then his plan is...

31:30.820 --> 31:31.880
Yes, I'm sure of it.

31:31.980 --> 31:35.320
The true horror of the Tragedy,
the Still Energy Phenomenon!

31:37.360 --> 31:41.560
That's right, ten years ago it started on a
night like this and lasted for seven days...

31:43.560 --> 31:48.660
The system that went out of
control not only vaporized Bashtarle...

31:48.900 --> 31:53.970
but its special properties also
neutralized all the power around the globe.

31:54.170 --> 31:58.800
The result was that the
Earth stood completely still.

31:59.750 --> 32:03.940
Yes, it was as if the Earth
itself trembled in fear...

32:05.750 --> 32:08.950
Aircraft fell from the skies like
birds with their wings torn off.

32:09.250 --> 32:11.420
All forms of travel were eliminated.

32:11.920 --> 32:14.420
Fires could not be put out...

32:14.930 --> 32:16.920
lifelines were cut off...

32:17.430 --> 32:19.920
and hospitals' emergency
systems ceased to work.

32:21.270 --> 32:24.530
It was a nightmarish week!

32:24.770 --> 32:29.140
Yes, the world was trapped in
what seemed like an eternal night...

32:29.240 --> 32:31.510
without the hope of a light.

32:32.380 --> 32:37.720
In the end, 2/3 of the world's
population had been lost...

32:37.850 --> 32:42.980
and we could do nothing
but watch it happen...

32:43.220 --> 32:44.250
Only watch...

32:45.160 --> 32:48.650
And what happened after the
power returned on the eighth day?

32:49.960 --> 32:53.190
They vilified Professor Vogler and
directed all their anger towards him.

32:53.970 --> 32:59.270
The remaining four scientists were
praised for their revised Shizuma Drive!

32:59.370 --> 33:00.960
As if nothing had happened!

33:01.370 --> 33:03.600
But I did not forget!

33:04.180 --> 33:06.370
And so I waited for the
day when the world was...

33:06.480 --> 33:08.470
completely immersed
in the Shizuma Drive!

33:08.780 --> 33:11.680
In order to have revenge
against the world that...

33:11.920 --> 33:14.110
buried the despised incident in lies!

33:19.760 --> 33:26.190
Now, this replica is configured to stop
all the Shizuma Drive energy in the world!

33:26.800 --> 33:30.330
And when the three
samples are together again...

33:30.670 --> 33:33.430
the world will once again
experience the true night!

33:33.610 --> 33:35.370
As it was in Bashtarle!

33:55.630 --> 33:58.220
The Earth is going still...

33:58.360 --> 34:00.700
How could something like this happen again?

34:01.270 --> 34:03.460
It's always the same...

34:03.700 --> 34:05.690
We're always too late...

34:07.740 --> 34:08.740
That's right...

34:10.340 --> 34:13.540
We didn't learn from
our mistakes in the past.

34:13.950 --> 34:17.040
All we did was put our
hopes into the ideals of...

34:17.150 --> 34:19.240
the Shizuma Drive and its promise.

34:22.120 --> 34:23.120
Taiso!

34:23.320 --> 34:24.320
Are you all right?

34:25.390 --> 34:26.150
Oh no!

34:26.330 --> 34:29.260
Robo launched at a time like this?

34:40.210 --> 34:42.040
Even my Uranus is without power!

34:42.610 --> 34:45.640
There's no mistake, this
is an Anti-Shizuma Drive!

34:45.940 --> 34:47.000
I'm sorry, Go.

34:48.180 --> 34:50.740
This is all my fault...

34:50.950 --> 34:53.820
No matter what I say now, it
will only sound like an excuse...

34:54.850 --> 34:56.690
But I will tell you the truth!

34:57.090 --> 35:00.530
What really happened ten years
ago, what really happened on that day!

35:00.690 --> 35:03.130
So please forgive me...

35:03.760 --> 35:04.760
Vogler...

35:08.800 --> 35:09.860
Professor!

35:10.170 --> 35:12.000
Professor!

35:14.370 --> 35:16.170
You half-dead old man!

35:19.310 --> 35:20.970
How dare you do what you did!

35:29.050 --> 35:29.540
Robo!

35:29.860 --> 35:30.860
What?

35:32.390 --> 35:33.980
Robo! Catch that man!

35:38.630 --> 35:39.630
How can this be?

35:39.700 --> 35:40.700
How...

35:43.500 --> 35:46.600
How can Robo still be moving
in the Bashtarle Phenomenon...

35:47.110 --> 35:48.870
when all power sources are stopped?

35:52.580 --> 35:53.580
Professor!

35:54.150 --> 35:55.150
Professor!

35:55.180 --> 35:55.840
Professor!

35:55.980 --> 35:59.350
I see, so that's the way Robo is...

35:59.750 --> 36:02.720
You can win, you can defeat Vogler...

36:09.330 --> 36:10.330
Such a thing...

36:20.310 --> 36:21.310
Good!

36:21.710 --> 36:23.040
Power has returned!

36:26.210 --> 36:27.940
Escape into the ocean!

36:44.160 --> 36:45.790
What strength!

37:31.680 --> 37:32.170
Robo!

37:32.680 --> 37:34.080
That's enough, you can stop!

37:36.310 --> 37:37.310
Robo!

38:19.520 --> 38:20.620
My apologies.

38:21.160 --> 38:24.320
I failed to recover the sample.

38:24.760 --> 38:26.230
I observed it...

38:26.700 --> 38:31.160
Ivan, why do you think it was able to
move in the Bashtarle Phenomenon?

38:33.040 --> 38:36.700
It appears that Robo's true identity
may be quite troublesome for us.

38:36.880 --> 38:37.880
Huh?

38:43.480 --> 38:44.480
How can that be?

38:44.550 --> 38:47.820
I mean, Giant Robo was
originally built by the BF Group and...

38:48.420 --> 38:49.080
No...

38:49.320 --> 38:52.450
Not even members of the Magnificent
Ten like myself were told...

38:52.520 --> 38:54.006
but I don't think there's
any other explanation.

38:54.030 --> 38:57.860
But Master Alberto, I thought even
the BF Group abandoned its use...

38:58.000 --> 39:01.020
when the Shizuma Drive was completed...

39:04.300 --> 39:05.300
I don't know...

39:05.340 --> 39:07.930
It's all the will of Big Fire.

39:13.950 --> 39:15.170
P-Please, I beg of you...

39:15.280 --> 39:19.050
At this rate, the mistakes of
ten years ago will be repeated.

39:19.680 --> 39:22.810
Please, stop Vogler!

39:23.490 --> 39:24.490
Professor...

39:24.590 --> 39:26.460
Professor, what should we do?

39:26.760 --> 39:28.850
It's not complete yet...

39:30.030 --> 39:32.791
As long as you don't allow that
last sample to fall into his hands...

39:33.000 --> 39:36.330
as long as all three
aren't brought together...

39:36.570 --> 39:37.570
I understand.

39:38.800 --> 39:39.460
Professor!

39:39.640 --> 39:41.660
Professor, if you
strain yourself further...

39:42.910 --> 39:44.710
It's all right...

39:45.710 --> 39:48.040
This moment was inevitable for me...

39:49.050 --> 39:50.050
Daisaku...

39:50.920 --> 39:51.920
Yes?

39:52.220 --> 39:53.780
You're our only chance...

39:54.650 --> 39:57.350
The world is relying on you and Robo...

39:58.260 --> 40:00.820
Only you two can stop Vogler.

40:01.430 --> 40:02.430
Yes.

40:03.160 --> 40:04.390
Daisaku...

40:05.360 --> 40:06.130
Robo...

40:06.330 --> 40:07.330
Is Robo...

40:16.680 --> 40:19.870
Yes Professor, Robo's
power source is nuclear.

40:28.850 --> 40:29.850
Professor!

40:30.160 --> 40:31.160
Professor!

40:33.020 --> 40:35.890
Professor!

40:41.470 --> 40:43.770
Robo's power source is nuclear...

40:44.000 --> 40:45.730
A legacy left from the past age...

40:48.870 --> 40:49.870
Ginrei?

40:53.180 --> 40:54.480
What a beautiful night...

40:57.920 --> 41:01.940
Yet people always forget
the dirty incidents of the past...

41:22.010 --> 41:30.010
<i>TO BE CONTINUED</i>

43:52.790 --> 43:56.420
The witness to the tragedy of ten
years ago, the black attache case...

43:56.590 --> 44:00.190
The immorality hidden in the light of
that glory unveils another mystery...

44:00.300 --> 44:02.460
and chooses Shanghai as its battlefield.

44:02.770 --> 44:06.500
But what of Daisaku Kusama who is
left behind onboard the Greta Garbo?

44:07.370 --> 44:09.770
Please, let me fight!

44:10.010 --> 44:12.380
Let me avenge the death
of Professor Shizuma!

44:12.610 --> 44:16.050
Or are you saying that you're afraid
of Robo's nuclear power source now?

44:17.280 --> 44:21.950
Next episode, "The Electromagnetic
Net Operation: The Fall at Shanghai."

44:22.150 --> 44:23.310
See you there!
